license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/pavanamthomas/sql-ml-feature-engineering-lab
url: https://github.com/pavanamthomas/sql-ml-feature-engineering-lab
abstract: >
  Point-in-time SQL feature engineering for relational event data.
  The repository is a laboratory: synthetic customers, accounts, and
  events are generated under a known DGP; correct queries are those
  that use only information at or before a prediction cutoff; leaky
  queries are checked with planted future-only sentinels.
keywords:
  - feature engineering
  - SQL
  - point-in-time
  - temporal leakage
  - window functions
  - machine learning
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-20"
